    "detailed_description": "<h1>Inspired by life</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a strong story that takes inspiration from real life.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a third person adventure game in open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the Story of Seppo with movie style cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game takes you to Finland 1994.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action packed Open World game with some RPG-Elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats you can upgrade\u00a0 (HP, XP, Levels, Power, Speed, Stamina, drunkennes, money, inventory, cars) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight mode like fighting games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy and drive cars, ride bikes, work, Drink...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crazy story is inspired by life and true locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day cycle and clock that affects shops etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather system.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a third person adventure game in open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the Story of Seppo with movie style cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game takes you to Finland 1994.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action packed Open World game with some RPG-Elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats you can upgrade\u00a0 (HP, XP, Levels, Power, Speed, Stamina, drunkennes, money, inventory, cars) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight mode like fighting games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy and drive cars, ride bikes, work, Drink...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crazy story is inspired by life and true locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day cycle and clock that affects shops etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather system.</p>",
    "short_description": "Last Drop is a story you need to experience. Welcome to Nykyl\u00e4 Finland 1994. Seppo Sahtivaara and friends are waiting for you. This is an openworld action game with a story that has an impact. We bring back old good games and action from the best movies from that era. We want you to enjoy!",
